"Bring things over from Firefox, Zen, Helium, Comet, Opera, Chrome's other channels and Arc, its spaces and pinned tabs included, or from an exported file." = "可以从 Firefox、Zen、Helium、Comet、Opera、Chrome 的其他通道和 Arc 导入数据，包括它的空间和固定标签页，也可以从导出的文件导入。";
"Site shortcuts: a word of your own before a search sends it to that site, like yt cats to YouTube." = "网站快捷搜索：搜索前加上你自己的词，就会把搜索发给那个网站，例如 yt cats 在 YouTube 中搜索。";
"Bookmarks in the order you choose, folders of your own, and a card to name a bookmark as you add it." = "书签按你选择的顺序排列，可以自建文件夹，添加书签时有卡片让你命名。";
"Videos can wait for a click, and every site can start at a zoom of your choice." = "视频可以等待点击，每个网站都能以你选定的缩放比例打开。";
"A double-click on a pinned tab takes it back to the page it was pinned at." = "双击固定的标签页，会回到它被固定时所在的页面。";
"Hold a back or forward swipe to pick a page from history." = "按住后退或前进的轻扫手势，可以从历史记录中挑选页面。";
"Scrolling asks far less of the window, and a tab still loading no longer keeps the Mac busy." = "滚动对窗口的负担小得多，仍在载入的标签页不再让 Mac 忙个不停。";
"Where links go, peeking at a link with a shift-click, and flicking the floating video to a corner are now on." = "链接的打开位置、按住 Shift 点击预览链接、把浮动视频甩到角落，现在都已开启。";
"Tab managers and other extensions see every tab, in every window." = "标签页管理器和其他扩展能看到每个窗口中的每个标签页。";
"Window › Move & Resize and the Mac's tiling work with Search's window." = "「窗口 › 移动与调整大小」和 Mac 的平铺功能可用于 Search 的窗口。";
"⌘K always opens the list of your tabs, whatever the page." = "无论当前是什么页面，⌘K 总能打开标签页列表。";
"⌘← and ⌘→ go back and forward again." = "⌘← 和 ⌘→ 重新可以后退和前进。";
"Links from Notion and other apps bring Search to the front." = "来自 Notion 和其他 App 的链接会把 Search 带到前台。";
"Addresses a dev server prints, like 0.0.0.0:3000, open." = "开发服务器打印的地址（如 0.0.0.0:3000）可以打开。";
"The tabs you had at quit are the ones that come back." = "退出时有哪些标签页，回来时就是哪些。";
"The × closes a tab in the tab bar folded away with ⌘S." = "用 ⌘S 收起标签栏后，× 也能关闭标签页。";
"1Password, Bitwarden, NordPass, Passbolt, iCloud Passwords and the Claude extension each get their fixes." = "1Password、Bitwarden、NordPass、Passbolt、iCloud 密码和 Claude 扩展各自得到修复。";
"And many smaller fixes." = "以及许多更小的修复。";
"Security, and the mouse wheel." = "安全性，以及鼠标滚轮。";
"Copying a saved password asks for Touch ID." = "拷贝已存储的密码需要 Touch ID。";
"A mouse wheel scrolls smoothly again on x.com and pages like it." = "在 x.com 及类似页面上，鼠标滚轮重新顺滑。";
"History opens at once." = "历史记录立即打开。";
"Music keeps playing when you switch spaces." = "切换空间时音乐继续播放。";
"Pop-ups need a click." = "弹出式窗口需要点击才会打开。";
"The holes found in this week's reviews: an extension could read files outside its own folder, and a page or an ad could open another app without asking." = "本周审查中发现的漏洞：扩展可以读取自己文件夹之外的文件，页面或广告可以不询问就打开其他 App。";
"Bitwarden signs in to a self-hosted server, and extension popups hear what changes while they're open." = "Bitwarden 可以登录自托管的服务器，扩展弹出窗口在打开期间能收到变化。";
"A link from Mail brings Search to the front, and a full-screen video no longer goes black." = "来自邮件的链接会把 Search 带到前台，全屏视频不再变黑。";
"Your extensions may each ask once more for their permissions at their next update." = "你的扩展在下次更新时，可能各自再询问一次权限。";
"Passkeys, password managers and Google." = "通行密钥、密码管理器和 Google。";
"A site's passkey button brings up the Mac's own passkey sheet: Touch ID, your iPhone, a security key." = "网站的通行密钥按钮会调出 Mac 自己的通行密钥面板：Touch ID、你的 iPhone、安全密钥。";
"Search can be the Mac's default browser." = "Search 可以成为这台 Mac 的默认浏览器。";
"Each off until you turn it on in Settings: a bookmarks bar, a peek at a link with a shift-click, the video that follows you to another app, pages at 120 Hz, and where a link goes." = "以下功能在设置中开启前都关闭：书签栏、按住 Shift 点击预览链接、跟随你到其他 App 的视频、120 Hz 页面，以及链接的打开位置。";
"Mute a tab, share a page, copy a link as Markdown, the mouse's back and forward buttons, and spaces in the bar across the top." = "将标签页静音、共享页面、以 Markdown 拷贝链接、鼠标的后退和前进按钮，以及顶栏中的空间。";
"Faster to open, and new tabs in about 10 ms." = "打开更快，新建标签页约需 10 毫秒。";
"Pages see nothing of Search that Safari doesn't show them, and a saved password is offered only on its own site." = "Search 向网页透露的信息不多于 Safari，已存储的密码只在其所属网站上提供。";
"1Password, Bitwarden and Proton Pass." = "1Password、Bitwarden 和 Proton Pass。";
"If passkeys still fail after the update, restart your Mac once." = "如果更新后通行密钥仍然失败，重启一次 Mac。";
"The first update, made of a day of your replies and pull requests." = "第一次更新，由你们一天的回复和拉取请求构成。";
"Each off until you turn it on in Settings: Spaces, a sidebar that hides until the pointer reaches the edge, and the search engine of your choice." = "以下功能在设置中开启前都关闭：空间、指针到达边缘才出现的侧栏，以及你选择的搜索引擎。";
"⌘S folds the sidebar away, a middle-click closes a tab, a tab can be renamed, and the Web Inspector is in the View menu." = "⌘S 收起侧栏，中键点击关闭标签页，标签页可以重命名，网页检查器在「显示」菜单中。";
"Search opens again on macOS 14." = "Search 在 macOS 14 上重新可以打开。";
"Signing in to Google no longer reloads the page over and over with iCloud Passwords installed." = "安装 iCloud 密码后，登录 Google 不再反复重新加载页面。";
"⌘1–⌘9 on every keyboard layout, Tab between a form's fields, dragging tabs, a double-click along the top to fill the screen, and the Mac's beep while typing." = "修好了：所有键盘布局上的 ⌘1–⌘9、表单字段间的 Tab、拖动标签页、双击顶部填满屏幕，以及输入时 Mac 的提示音。";
"The first version. A browser for the Mac with nothing in the way." = "第一个版本。为 Mac 做的不挡路的浏览器。";
"Tabs in a row or down the side, pinned tabs that keep their place, and one field for addresses and searches." = "标签页排成一行或沿侧边排列，固定的标签页保持位置，地址与搜索共用一个输入框。";
"Ads blocked before they load; passwords and passkeys in your keychain." = "广告在载入前就被拦截；密码和通行密钥存在你的钥匙串中。";
"Anything on a page can be hidden; articles open in a reading mode and videos float." = "页面上的任何内容都可以隐藏；文章以阅读模式打开，视频可以浮动。";
"Chrome extensions from the Chrome Web Store, on macOS 15.4 or later." = "来自 Chrome 应用商店的 Chrome 扩展，需要 macOS 15.4 或更高版本。";
